    "description": "The Master of Arts in Digital Journalism programme alumni, student and faculty held a webinar that aimed to address the role of policy, satire and images of death in the coverage of Covid-19. This is the second webinar that has been conducted by the Graduate School of Media and Communications that aims to address the challenges and opportunities in the media and communications sector.",
